    "reviews": "\u201cIn Ten Dates, the characters are all relatable on some level, and the way relationships progress feels natural. All in all: play it! You\u2019ll fall in love.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Digitally Downloaded<br><br>\u201cTen Dates might be one of our favourite FMVs to date. It\u2019s sweet, it\u2019s fun, and it\u2019s packed with larger-than-life characters that we had an absolute blast getting to know.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Game Spew<br><br>\u201cAn entertaining and genuinely funny FMV rom com. Plenty of diverse and interesting characters, great acting throughout, Bash is the best video game character of all time\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 God is a Geek<br>",
